Step 1: Create the Google Sheet
Open Google Sheets and create a Blank spreadsheet.

Name the sheet something fun, like Cell Dungeon.

Step 2: Add the Game Code
In the top menu, click on Extensions > Apps Script.

Delete any code in the editor (myFunction( )).

Paste the entire script below into the editor
Step 3: Launch and Play!
Go back to your Google Sheet tab. (Note: Refresh the browser tab so the custom menu loads properly).

In the top menu bar, click on Zen Sanctuary > Start New Game.
